    "note": "OpenMU VersionSeasonSix (KanturuRuins.cs:274): level 100, 44370 life, 555-590, 443, 728/255, attack every 1550 ms. Raised past Aida (decision 3): two above the Gigantis, its numbers the Splinter Wolf's times OpenMU's ratio between the two (life 2.77, damage 1.79/1.74, defense 1.93); ranges and speeds as MU. Ours (2026-10-23). Retuned 2026-10-25 for geared level-400 heroes (the user: a step harder than Aida, a steady climb from the camp): life 103,500 (Wolf) to 138,000 (Genocider), damage 1,250 to 1,680, defence 620 to 700, levels and rates kept -- about 1.3x Aida's typical time to kill on average, measured with the best pre-Kanturu kits (a scratch skill_sweep at each nest). The defence MU's scale gave (780 to 1,747) left melee and bows at the damage floor."
  },
  "why_this_one": "The Ruins' seventh breed and its most common: 28 OpenMU spots in the north and west (x 31-188, y 11-104), past the Gigantis (docs/worlds/kanturu-port.md 4.1, 4.4).",
